   341	    // or `data_size` past the buffer end) yields `None` instead of a
   342	    // panicking slice. `Control::list`/`table`/`info` bound their reads the
   343	    // same way via the iterator loop; this is the one direct-slice path.
   344	    let len = buf.len();
